From caa824a90d51e85112547902c1c12e3dab004d10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rafael Lordao <rafaellordao@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 01:07:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(crm): replace free-text selector fields with
 dropdowns/combobox

- Add reusable Combobox and ComboboxMulti components (src/components/ui/combobox.tsx)
- Add UnitSelect component for quote/invoice line item unit field
- Lead form: Source is now a Select with fixed options instead of free text
- Lead form: Activites souhaitees is now a multi-select Combobox backed by the
  same catalog data source as CatalogLinePicker, with a free-text add option
- CatalogLinePicker: swap plain Select for the new searchable Combobox,
  keeping the Saisie manuelle escape hatch
- quote-form/invoice-form: Unite field now uses UnitSelect with fixed options
  and a fallback text input for custom/legacy values
